1
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:13,220
Paid strategies are in the Marketplace. Search for one and open it.

2
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:17,580
Some strategies are paid. The price shows here, with any free trial.

3
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:23,500
Test it runs it in the Tester first. No purchase needed.

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:38,200
Its inputs are ready. Pick symbols and press Start to back-test it.

5
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:44,820
To rent or buy it, you pay from your Marketplace wallet. Your balance shows underneath.

6
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:51,490
Check the plan, your balance and what is left after paying. Pay makes it yours at once.

7
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,350
Here we cancel.

8
00:00:53,450 --> 00:01:02,330
Or try it free first. A trial is for demo accounts, once per strategy.

9
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:06,330
Purchased lists everything you've bought, rented or are trying.

